[57.073602, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ncd /app && python - <<'PY'\r\nimport cProfile,pstats,io,mujoco,numpy as np\r\nm=mujoco.MjModel.from_xml_path('model_ref.xml'); d=mujoco.MjData(m)\r\nrng=np.random.default_rng(0); d.qpos += rng.normal(0,0.01,size=d.qpos.shape); mujoco.mj_forward(m,d)\r\ndef run():\r\n for i in range(1000): mujoco.mj_step(m,d)\r\npr=cProfile.Profile(); pr.enable(); run(); pr.disable()\r\ns=io.StringIO(); pstats.Stats(pr,stream=s).sort_stats('cumtime').print_stats(40); print(s.getvalue())\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
