[80.504233, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ncd /app && python - <<'PY'\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\ns=Path('model_ref.xml').read_text()\r\ns=s.replace('<compiler autolimits=\"true\"/>','<compiler autolimits=\"true\"/>\\n  <option solver=\"PGS\" jacobian=\"dense\"/>')\r\nPath('model.xml').write_text(s)\r\nprint(Path('model.xml').read_text())\r\nPY\r\npython eval.py\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
