[140.693559, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ncd /app && python - <<'PY'\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\ns=Path('model_ref.xml').read_text()\r\ns=s.replace('<compiler autolimits=\"true\"/>','<compiler autolimits=\"true\"/>\\n  <option solver=\"PGS\" jacobian=\"dense\" tolerance=\"0\"/>')\r\nPath('model.xml').write_text(s)\r\nPY\r\npython - <<'PY'\r\nimport mujoco\r\nm=mujoco.MjModel.from_xml_path('/app/model.xml')\r\nprint('solver',m.opt.solver,'jacobian',m.opt.jacobian,'tolerance',m.opt.tolerance,'iterations',m.opt.iterations)\r\nPY\r\ncd /app && for i in 1 2 3; do python eval.py || exit 1; done\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
